  "prefLabel": "Agr 1408.06 Kerosene Fuel Labeling & Equipment Specifications",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-09-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1408.06 Kerosene Fuel Labeling & Equipment Specifications.\n\n(a) Kerosene offered for sale or sold shall:\n\n(1) Be labeled as kerosene; and\n\n(2) Comply with the standard specification in NIST Handbook 130, Uniform Laws and Regulations, Section III, G, Uniform Engine Fuels, Petroleum Products, and Automotive Lubricants Regulation as required by RSA 438:20.\n\n(b) Pumps dispensing kerosene shall be labeled in compliance with NIST Handbook 130, Uniform Laws and Regulations, Section III, G, Uniform Engine Fuels, Petroleum Products, and Automotive Lubricants Regulation as required by RSA 438:20.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #7462, eff 3-21-01; ss by #9416, INTERIM, eff 3-13-09, EXPIRED: 9-9-09\n\nNew. #9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1400.html"
